              Manage rules for automatic campaign generation. Create rules for recurring campaigns (weekly, biweekly, monthly) for your state.
            </p>
            <button
              onClick={() => router.push(`/admin/campaign-rules?state=${encodeURIComponent(stateToUse)}`)}
